  "observations": [
    "W exporter maps raw reflectionDefinition.fresnel to exported reflection.power unchanged, and fresnelColor unchanged. W skin factory passes power directly into material fresnel; material assigns fresnelPower unchanged and uses pow(facing,fresnelPower). No native 4.9*x+0.1 mapping exists in that chain at this snapshot.",
    "Native rim is vFresnel.rgb=child.fresnelColor(+30/+34/+38), w=FMA32(child.fresnel(+2c),4.9f,0.1f). This is distinct from reflectionFresnel(+18), which independently receives the same numeric mapping into vReflection.x, with opacityDirect/Glancing(+10/+14). Do not substitute one source field for the other. W authors only rim fresnel/color; source color W is not used for native rim RGB.",
